        <p>It was peaolved to ner.d h. t llowiog telegram to Sir. GeorgePikrgton :—" Lancashire and C hoihire Council. in crnference assenrled, dec.&amp; to ask if you woulif FX• plain your plsition or, Shr.p Bila (Sir Char'e3 Diles) at 5 ow, me- tiny on Mon6ay.</p>
        <p>Tie usual votes of that Ir; brought the meeting to an end.</p>
      </div>
