        <p>Tne coffia was of oak ani handsonagy brass mountei. It was eovered with the U lion Jack, and upon it lay ,he arms and At.toutrem snts of the &amp;mimed nolonel, as well as a beautiful wreath from his re!aives It bore the simp inacriptiln " John Ashton. Med 26th May,1899, Aged 60 years." Ch uadsrtakers were Mimrs. Proud and Pollard, Frodsham.</p>
