      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-06-02_WidnesExaminer_art0086" n="art0086">
        <head>GOOD F MEDICINE CHEST,</head>
        <p>A GOOD F MEDICINE CHEST,</p>
        <p>W ITH a prudent use, has saved many a life, and yet we think the idea might be improved upon and reduced to a more simple form. Take some good Compound such</p>
        <p>COCKLE'S ANTIBILIOUS PILLS,</p>
        <p>and we find that the desired end may be obtained without scales and weights, or little mysterious compartments, and enchanted bottles with crystal stoppers. Others might be used, but COCKLE'S PILLS as tested by many thousands of persons, and found to answer their purposes so well, may be set down as the best. —Observer.</p>
